profile.comment=Sets every performance-related option, and cave adaptation, at once. Options can still be changed one by one afterwards
profile.POTATO=§7Potato
profile.POTATO.comment=Every costly effect off or at its lowest, with small, soft shadows (a 256-pixel map out to 16 blocks, no mob shadows)
profile.ABZA=§aABZA
profile.ABZA.comment=The pack's default: the settings it was tuned at. Off: ray-traced bounce light, depth of field, coloured shadows from glass, underwater caustics, cloud shadows, and block-entity shadows (chests, signs, modded machines), which cost the most processor time for the least visible gain. Shadows use a 1024-pixel map out to 80 blocks
profile.HIGH=§bHigh
profile.HIGH.comment=The ABZA preset with sharper shadows (a 2048-pixel map), sharper ground at shallow angles (anisotropic filter 4), depth of field and underwater caustics
profile.ULTRA=§dUltra
profile.ULTRA.comment=The ABZA preset with the sharpest shadows (a 4096-pixel map), coloured shadows from glass, cloud shadows, underwater caustics, reflections on every surface that isn't fully rough with the High reflection filter, and anisotropic filter 8
profile.MAX=§6Max
profile.MAX.comment=The Ultra preset plus ray-traced bounce light with 4 rays per pixel (16 frames blended), and no cave adaptation
